NOTE: The last access search will only return courses that were created before the date provided.

NOTE: The amount of email addresses found may differ from the emails sent.  This has 2 causes. 

   1. A course that is already hidden will not send out an email to notify the owner(s) if the course is selected to be hidden.

   2. A single address that shows up under multiple courses will be joined into a single email.


